              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Asa kajisi impi yabasilumamba ibakali kusama intobo amasumo, bantu ba-Juda bali zyuulu zili myanda yotatwe, aba-Benjamini ibakajisi intobo akufusa mata bali zyuulu zili myanda yobile azyuulu zili makumi aali musanu aatatu, Aba boonse bakali baalumi basintaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
