        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Asa abantu mbaakali abo bakali kuya bubatanda mane kusikila ku-Gerari, nkabela ba-Kusi bakajayigwa mane kakutakwe naba omwe iwakasyaala muumi, nkaambo bakazundwa kubusyu bwaJehova abwabasilumamba bakwe, Alimwi ba-Juda bakasaala imbono zinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
