        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakazunda minzi yoonse iyakeengelede Gerari, nkaambo buyoofu bwa-Jehova bwakabayoosya, aboobo bakasaala minzi yoonse, nkaambo kakuli imbono zinji mulinjiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
